# HOME → Online → Update finds a newer release, shows what is new in it, and asks again before
# installing; B then keeps the Slot there is. L1 / R1 scroll notes too long for the screen.
# With Wi-Fi off the row is greyed out. Once Wi-Fi is up, the footer shows a newer Slot is out.
press a
phase Shelf
press menu
phase QuickMenu
press up
press up      # Online
press a
press up      # Update, the last of Online's rows
snap menu-update-offline
press b
press b
phase Shelf
set online 1
wait 1000
# Wi-Fi up for the first time this boot: the newer release puts its symbol beside Wi-Fi's.
snap shelf-update-icon
press menu
phase QuickMenu
press up
press up      # Online
press a
press up      # Update
press a
wait 1000
snap update-found
# Notes longer than the screen: R1 scrolls down through them, L1 back up.
press r1
press r1
snap update-scrolled
press l1
press l1
press a
snap update-confirm
press b
snap update-kept
press b
phase QuickMenu
